{"question_id":"luy9cm5p","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 9th April Morning Shift","year":2024,"subject":"physics","chapter":"electronic-devices","chapterGroup":"modern-physics","type":"mcq","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"content":"<p>A light emitting diode (LED) is fabricated using GaAs semiconducting material whose band gap is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.081ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3572 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\"></use><use data-c=\"56\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-56\" transform=\"translate(444,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. The wavelength of light emitted from the LED is :</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"1243 nm"},{"identifier":"B","content":"875 nm"},{"identifier":"C","content":"650 nm"},{"identifier":"D","content":"1400 nm"}],"correct_options":["B"],"explanation":"<p>The wavelength of light emitted by a Light Emitting Diode (LED) fabricated using a semiconducting material can be determined by the energy band gap of the material. The energy of the photon emitted, which corresponds to the band gap energy, is given by the equation:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.8ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.355ex\" height=\"2.801ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -884.7 3251 1238.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1041.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2097.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"210E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-210E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(576,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(370.6,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><rect width=\"913.5\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Where:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li><b><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.729ex\" height=\"1.538ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -680 764 680\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></b> is the energy of the emitted photon (in joules when <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.303ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 576 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"210E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-210E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.98ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 433 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> are in SI units), corresponding to the band gap energy of the material.</li>\n\n<li><b><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.303ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 576 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"210E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-210E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></b> is Planck's constant (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21.191ex\" height=\"2.538ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -871.8 9366.2 1121.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2500.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(3500.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1033,393.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(5840.7,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(6007.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(866,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(1269.6,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1436.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"6B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6B\"></use><use data-c=\"67\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-67\" transform=\"translate(528,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2464.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2964.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>).</li>\n\n<li><b><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.98ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 433 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></b> is the speed of light in vacuum (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.192ex\" height=\"2.52ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864 5831 1114\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1500.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(2500.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1033,393.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(3937,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(4104,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"><use data-c=\"2F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1333,0)\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>).</li>\n\n<li><b><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.027ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.319ex\" height=\"1.597ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 583 706\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></b> is the wavelength of the emitted light (in meters).</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p>However, since the energy band gap given is in electronvolts (eV), and we are looking for the wavelength in nanometers (nm), we can use the energy formula directly in terms of eV and then do the unit conversion conveniently. The conversion between energy (in eV) and wavelength (in nm) without needing to convert eV to Joules is facilitated by the equation:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.238ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.611ex\" height=\"3.212ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -872.7 6458.2 1419.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(583,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(972,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\"></use><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2361,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3027.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(4083.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(480.2,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-370.3) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(764,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1153,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\"></use><use data-c=\"56\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-56\" transform=\"translate(444,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2347,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"2134.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Here, 1240 nm\u00b7eV is a conversion factor used for directly converting energy in eV to wavelength in nm.</p>\n\n<p>Given the band gap energy of GaAs is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.081ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3572 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\"></use><use data-c=\"56\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-56\" transform=\"translate(444,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, the wavelength (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.027ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.319ex\" height=\"1.597ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 583 706\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) of light emitted can be found as:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22.333ex\" height=\"2.755ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -872.7 9871.3 1217.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(860.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1916.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(298.5,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><rect width=\"1614.2\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4048.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5104.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(2278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(7882.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\"></use><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Thus, the wavelength of light emitted from the LED is approximately 873.24 nm, which is closest to:</p>\n\n<p>Option B: 875 nm.</p>","qKey":"luy9cm5p","paperKey":"jee-main-2024-online-9th-april-morning-shift","exam":"jee-main","questions":[{"question_id":"luy9cm5p","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 9th April Morning Shift","year":2024,"subject":"physics","chapter":"electronic-devices","chapterGroup":"modern-physics","type":"mcq","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"content":"<p>A light emitting diode (LED) is fabricated using GaAs semiconducting material whose band gap is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.081ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3572 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\"></use><use data-c=\"56\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-56\" transform=\"translate(444,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. The wavelength of light emitted from the LED is :</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"1243 nm"},{"identifier":"B","content":"875 nm"},{"identifier":"C","content":"650 nm"},{"identifier":"D","content":"1400 nm"}],"correct_options":["B"],"explanation":"<p>The wavelength of light emitted by a Light Emitting Diode (LED) fabricated using a semiconducting material can be determined by the energy band gap of the material. The energy of the photon emitted, which corresponds to the band gap energy, is given by the equation:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.8ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.355ex\" height=\"2.801ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -884.7 3251 1238.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1041.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2097.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"210E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-210E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(576,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(370.6,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><rect width=\"913.5\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Where:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li><b><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.729ex\" height=\"1.538ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -680 764 680\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></b> is the energy of the emitted photon (in joules when <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.303ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 576 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"210E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-210E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.98ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 433 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> are in SI units), corresponding to the band gap energy of the material.</li>\n\n<li><b><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.303ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 576 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"210E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-210E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></b> is Planck's constant (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21.191ex\" height=\"2.538ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -871.8 9366.2 1121.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2500.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(3500.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1033,393.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(5840.7,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(6007.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(866,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(1269.6,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1436.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"6B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6B\"></use><use data-c=\"67\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-67\" transform=\"translate(528,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2464.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2964.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>).</li>\n\n<li><b><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.98ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 433 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></b> is the speed of light in vacuum (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.192ex\" height=\"2.52ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864 5831 1114\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1500.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(2500.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1033,393.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(3937,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(4104,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"><use data-c=\"2F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1333,0)\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>).</li>\n\n<li><b><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.027ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.319ex\" height=\"1.597ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 583 706\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></b> is the wavelength of the emitted light (in meters).</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p>However, since the energy band gap given is in electronvolts (eV), and we are looking for the wavelength in nanometers (nm), we can use the energy formula directly in terms of eV and then do the unit conversion conveniently. The conversion between energy (in eV) and wavelength (in nm) without needing to convert eV to Joules is facilitated by the equation:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.238ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.611ex\" height=\"3.212ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -872.7 6458.2 1419.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(583,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(972,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\"></use><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2361,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3027.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(4083.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(480.2,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-370.3) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(764,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1153,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\"></use><use data-c=\"56\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-56\" transform=\"translate(444,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2347,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"2134.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Here, 1240 nm\u00b7eV is a conversion factor used for directly converting energy in eV to wavelength in nm.</p>\n\n<p>Given the band gap energy of GaAs is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.081ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3572 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\"></use><use data-c=\"56\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-56\" transform=\"translate(444,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, the wavelength (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.027ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.319ex\" height=\"1.597ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 583 706\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) of light emitted can be found as:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22.333ex\" height=\"2.755ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -872.7 9871.3 1217.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(860.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1916.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(298.5,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><rect width=\"1614.2\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4048.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5104.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(2278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(7882.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\"></use><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Thus, the wavelength of light emitted from the LED is approximately 873.24 nm, which is closest to:</p>\n\n<p>Option B: 875 nm.</p>","qKey":"luy9cm5p","paperKey":"jee-main-2024-online-9th-april-morning-shift","exam":"jee-main"}]}